I omitted the two operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so the body cannot write to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or call the metadata service. The metadata request would also send each input's text to an external host, which this node is not authorized to do. If operations needs either behavior, it belongs in a separate node whose `with` clause grants the matching capability.

